  "template.clinic.guideFlow": "In List of pages, search and select a patient under Billing Clinic to open their billing workspace in a new tab. Open Invoices & payments, then View bill for the full invoice, insurance, line totals, receipts and revision history. Edit bill changes quantities, discount, insurance authorization and notes on unpaid issued invoices. Enter a correction reason and confirm. The API recalculates using its current tariffs and retains the previous invoice snapshot. Payment history, including refunds, prevents edits. Conflicts require loading and reviewing the latest ledger before saving again. Unsaved correction values survive recoverable failures; Back to billing confirms discard.",
  "template.clinic.guideIntegration": "Use the public typed workspace and adapters shown in TypeScript. The authenticated demo API reads patient CSV and writes a separate billing CSV ledger. Replace adapters to connect another application.",
  "template.clinic.guidePreferences": "Uses effective tenant-locked preferences for layout, theme, fonts, density, tables, dates and number display. Ledger currency comes from the API and is not converted by a display preference.",
  "template.clinic.guideRecovery": "Input remains on screen during recoverable errors. Retry reuses operation identity. Load the latest ledger after a conflict and review your retained input. Browser-close draft restoration is not provided.",
  "template.clinic.guideLimits": "Fictional single-process demo: no real card processing, insurance submission, tax certification, pharmacy dispensing or accounting posting. Refunds reverse a full payment; invoices cannot be edited after issue.",
