  "template.triage.guideFlow": "Select a patient. Enter the complaint, observed vital signs, allergy review, manual priority and next care area. Save a draft or review and complete. Previous assessments opens saved drafts and completed history. New assessment starts empty readings.",
  "template.triage.guideIntegration": "Use ClinicalTriageWorkspace with the typed triage and patient adapters shown in the TypeScript example. Authenticated API calls read patient CSV and persist assessments in a separate tenant/application/patient-scoped triage CSV.",
  "template.triage.guidePreferences": "Use the numbered master-record rail to move between Complaint & safety, Vital signs and Disposition & handoff. One section is visible at a time beside the triage snapshot. Save draft and Complete triage stay in the action bar. Tabs and wizard remain available through effective preferences. Values, choices, history and saves use the demo API; the summary reflects entered data and is not a clinical recommendation.",
