  "designer.dubai": "Dubai",
  "designer.help.dependencies": "For dependent dropdowns, create Country with IN|India and AE|UAE. Create State with KL|Kerala, KA|Karnataka, AZ|Abu Dhabi and DU|Dubai. In State properties choose Depends on: Country, then map KL/KA to IN and AZ/DU to AE. Or insert the API-provided Country → State example. Preview loads options from the API, disables children until a valid parent is selected, and clears all descendants on parent changes. Retry failed lookups without losing parent selections. Validate preview checks matching parent/child IDs on the demo API without saving answers. Cycles, missing parents, unmapped options and more than five dependency links are rejected. Company → Branch uses the same generic configuration. Dataset imports and multi-parent conditions are not included.",
