  "designer.help.catalog": "Open Manage value sets to create option lists shared within the current tenant and application. Only administrators can save new revisions. Use Relationships to select exact parent and child set revisions and map every child option. In field settings, choose an Option source revision; dependent fields also select their parent field and a compatible Shared relationship. Existing forms remain pinned when a new revision is saved. Adopting new revisions is explicit. Refresh catalog preserves edits; after a conflict, reopen the latest revision before saving. Catalog changes do not save or replace your current form. Inline options remain supported. Limits are 50 options per set and 100 retained revisions each for sets and relationships. Production DCP integration, inactive-value policies and publication approvals remain pending.",
