  "1. Choose Healthcare Suite, branch and facility. Open this RCM destination. 2. Inspect the current version, currency and records. 3. Choose Workflow action and complete its required fields. Configure a payer profile with REST JSON, REST XML, SOAP 1.1 or SOAP 1.2. Queue an operation, then dispatch the queued request and inspect its outcome. Server endpoints and credentials must be configured separately. 4. Submit the action and review the updated records or error.": "1. Choose Healthcare Suite, branch and facility. Open this RCM destination. 2. Inspect the current version, currency and records. 3. Choose Workflow action and complete its required fields. Configure a payer profile with REST JSON, REST XML, SOAP 1.1 or SOAP 1.2. Queue an operation, then dispatch the queued request and inspect its outcome. Server endpoints and credentials must be configured separately. 4. Submit the action and review the updated records or error.",
  "1. Choose Healthcare Suite, branch and facility. Open this RCM destination. 2. Inspect the current version, currency and records. 3. Choose Workflow action and complete its required fields. Configure ordered payer IDs against an invoice, create the next payer claim, record adjudication and retain denial appeal history. 4. Submit the action and review the updated records or error.": "1. Choose Healthcare Suite, branch and facility. Open this RCM destination. 2. Inspect the current version, currency and records. 3. Choose Workflow action and complete its required fields. Configure ordered payer IDs against an invoice, create the next payer claim, record adjudication and retain denial appeal history. 4. Submit the action and review the updated records or error.",
  "1. Choose Healthcare Suite, branch and facility. Open this RCM destination. 2. Inspect the current version, currency and records. 3. Choose Workflow action and complete its required fields. Create a pricing revision with explicit unit price and tax basis points. Have a different authorized actor approve it before publication. Existing published records retain their values. 4. Submit the action and review the updated records or error.": "1. Choose Healthcare Suite, branch and facility. Open this RCM destination. 2. Inspect the current version, currency and records. 3. Choose Workflow action and complete its required fields. Create a pricing revision with explicit unit price and tax basis points. Have a different authorized actor approve it before publication. Existing published records retain their values. 4. Submit the action and review the updated records or error.",
  "1. Choose Healthcare Suite, branch and facility. Open this RCM destination. 2. Inspect the current version, currency and records. 3. Choose Workflow action and complete its required fields. Define the package included quantity and case-rate/excess pricing, grant a patient entitlement, reserve quantity, and consume actual delivered quantity. Release only unused reservations. 4. Submit the action and review the updated records or error.": "1. Choose Healthcare Suite, branch and facility. Open this RCM destination. 2. Inspect the current version, currency and records. 3. Choose Workflow action and complete its required fields. Define the package included quantity and case-rate/excess pricing, grant a patient entitlement, reserve quantity, and consume actual delivered quantity. Release only unused reservations. 4. Submit the action and review the updated records or error.",
  "1. Choose Healthcare Suite, branch and facility. Open this RCM destination. 2. Inspect the current version, currency and records. 3. Choose Workflow action and complete its required fields. Record a patient deposit with a payment reference. Allocate available deposit to an invoice or issue a credit. Request a refund against exactly one eligible deposit or credit, then use a different authorized reviewer to approve it. 4. Submit the action and review the updated records or error.": "1. Choose Healthcare Suite, branch and facility. Open this RCM destination. 2. Inspect the current version, currency and records. 3. Choose Workflow action and complete its required fields. Record a patient deposit with a payment reference. Allocate available deposit to an invoice or issue a credit. Request a refund against exactly one eligible deposit or credit, then use a different authorized reviewer to approve it. 4. Submit the action and review the updated records or error.",
  "1. Choose Healthcare Suite, branch and facility. Open this RCM destination. 2. Inspect the current version, currency and records. 3. Choose Workflow action and complete its required fields. Review journal entries, trial balance and reconciliation output. Run the supported reconciliation action and export only when role and effective CSV export policy permit it. 4. Submit the action and review the updated records or error.": "1. Choose Healthcare Suite, branch and facility. Open this RCM destination. 2. Inspect the current version, currency and records. 3. Choose Workflow action and complete its required fields. Review journal entries, trial balance and reconciliation output. Run the supported reconciliation action and export only when role and effective CSV export policy permit it. 4. Submit the action and review the updated records or error.",
  "1. Choose Healthcare Suite, branch and facility. Open this RCM destination. 2. Inspect the current version, currency and records. 3. Choose Workflow action and complete its required fields. Review outstanding invoices, aging and payer exposure. Record collection evidence through the configured workflow; review statements and resulting ledger balances. 4. Submit the action and review the updated records or error.": "1. Choose Healthcare Suite, branch and facility. Open this RCM destination. 2. Inspect the current version, currency and records. 3. Choose Workflow action and complete its required fields. Review outstanding invoices, aging and payer exposure. Record collection evidence through the configured workflow; review statements and resulting ledger balances. 4. Submit the action and review the updated records or error.",
  "1. Choose Healthcare Suite, branch and facility. Open this RCM destination. 2. Inspect the current version, currency and records. 3. Choose Workflow action and complete its required fields. Select a claim, enter received and adjusted amounts with a payment reference, then apply the remittance. For a clawback select the original remittance, enter the bounded amount and reason. 4. Submit the action and review the updated records or error.": "1. Choose Healthcare Suite, branch and facility. Open this RCM destination. 2. Inspect the current version, currency and records. 3. Choose Workflow action and complete its required fields. Select a claim, enter received and adjusted amounts with a payment reference, then apply the remittance. For a clawback select the original remittance, enter the bounded amount and reason. 4. Submit the action and review the updated records or error.",
  "1. Choose Healthcare Suite, branch and facility. Open this RCM destination. 2. Inspect the current version, currency and records. 3. Choose Workflow action and complete its required fields. Select the supported grouping action and supply its coded input. Inspect the persisted grouping result and demo classification. This synthetic adapter is not a certified production grouper. 4. Submit the action and review the updated records or error.": "1. Choose Healthcare Suite, branch and facility. Open this RCM destination. 2. Inspect the current version, currency and records. 3. Choose Workflow action and complete its required fields. Select the supported grouping action and supply its coded input. Inspect the persisted grouping result and demo classification. This synthetic adapter is not a certified production grouper. 4. Submit the action and review the updated records or error.",
