  "Integration": "Integration",
  "MockIns exchange supports USD, EUR, INR and AED. Currency conversion is not performed.": "MockIns exchange supports USD, EUR, INR and AED. Currency conversion is not performed.",
  "Money inputs use the displayed transaction currency and up to two decimal places. Commands require the latest workspace version and an operation key. A changed-key conflict or stale version does not overwrite state. Use Reload latest workspace after a version conflict. Preserve an uncertain provider operation and reconcile it before attempting another payment.": "Money inputs use the displayed transaction currency and up to two decimal places. Commands require the latest workspace version and an operation key. A changed-key conflict or stale version does not overwrite state. Use Reload latest workspace after a version conflict. Preserve an uncertain provider operation and reconcile it before attempting another payment.",
  "The host validates tenant, product, branch, module and selected active facility. Server command capabilities govern finance, claim, configuration and review actions separately. An unavailable capability disables the action; UI state alone grants no authority. Shared effective theme, density, table and formatter preferences apply. A facility change discards the old facility form.": "The host validates tenant, product, branch, module and selected active facility. Server command capabilities govern finance, claim, configuration and review actions separately. An unavailable capability disables the action; UI state alone grants no authority. Shared effective theme, density, table and formatter preferences apply. A facility change discards the old facility form.",
  "The injected host transport reads GET /api/rcm/workspace and submits POST /api/rcm/commands. Durable synthetic financial partitions and provider connections are server-owned. Importing an existing invoice freezes a validated server snapshot and prevents independent source billing collection/cancellation. Mock/provider acceptance is separate from production credentials, certification and jurisdiction review.": "The injected host transport reads GET /api/rcm/workspace and submits POST /api/rcm/commands. Durable synthetic financial partitions and provider connections are server-owned. Importing an existing invoice freezes a validated server snapshot and prevents independent source billing collection/cancellation. Mock/provider acceptance is separate from production credentials, certification and jurisdiction review.",
  "The refund source needs a captured provider payment before payout.": "The refund source needs a captured provider payment before payout.",
