  "ui.reference.surgisuite.7dd63a27029a19cd": "Surgical time by specialty, actual against planned",
  "ui.reference.surgisuite.a0e04c21873df61c": "Team & equipment",
  "ui.reference.surgisuite.4bded171e9258fd9": "Team members are checked against their credentials. People with a recorded time in stay on the record; use hand over to sign them out.",
  "ui.reference.surgisuite.bf4043a9b3dff077": "Technique",
  "ui.reference.surgisuite.532eaabd9574880d": "Test",
  "ui.reference.surgisuite.50d7491e056387a2": "The case has started, so theatre and time are fixed. Correct milestone times from the activity tab if needed.",
  "ui.reference.surgisuite.a498076b4618b6f8": "The chart appears when the first set of vitals is recorded.",
  "ui.reference.surgisuite.c942b2b68187305a": "The claim applies -51 to lower-value secondary procedures, -50 for bilateral, LT/RT for sided procedures and -80 for an assistant surgeon. ICD link checks the CPT–diagnosis mapping in Masters.",
  "ui.reference.surgisuite.2a1e0ad65a8407e2": "The operative report is signed, so coding is locked. Start an amendment on the report tab to change it.",
  "ui.reference.surgisuite.c2010f231bd84f94": "The original time and the reason are kept in the audit log.",
  "ui.reference.surgisuite.bdd4ef67a758c261": "The pick list comes from the procedure preference cards. Implants need lot and serial numbers before usage can be posted.",
  "ui.reference.surgisuite.f4c2ba4a5dad7067": "The signed version is archived with its signature. The new version must be signed again.",
